WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:03,190
Father

2
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:04,190
What's the matter with us?

3
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:08,190
I dare to know that a species with strength reaching level nine has entered the peach forest

4
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:09,190
these days

5
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:12,190
Marks of a large number of seventh- and eighth-grade species disappeared one after another

6
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:14,190
It's most likely what it did today

7
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:15,190
it has entered the inside position

8
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:17,190
Can you locate it? No.

9
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:19,190
Its spiritual mark is very different

10
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:21,190
I can only follow the direction in which the species disappears

11
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:22,190
Determine approximate location

12
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:24,190
Our secrets must not be exposed

13
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:25,190
especially now

14
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:27,190
Blood Spirit is about to mature, right?

15
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:28,190
Hurry and find that ninth-grade one

16
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:30,190
Don't let it cause trouble

17
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:35,940
Ninth grade fear rabbit

18
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:36,940
Not easy to mess with during the day

19
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:38,940
I'm just a shrimp at night

20
00:00:47,810 --> 00:00:48,810
Rabbit with beads on hand
